## Interface: 16001
## Title: Cabbie
## Notes: Turn-by-turn navigation for World of Warcraft: Forever. Search a destination, preview the fastest route including flights and boats, then follow the route steps beside your quest list, a turn call-out, map lines and optional voice guidance.
## Author: Cabbie contributors
## Version: 1.1.0
## SavedVariables: CabbieDB, CabbieQuests
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: CabbieCharDB
## X-License: GPL-3.0-or-later
## X-Category: Map & Minimap
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Cabbie\Media\icon

# Load order follows docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 4: Libs -> Locale -> Core -> Data -> Nav -> UI -> Core\Boot.lua.
